#: ../clips.rst:332
msgid ":guilabel:`Reset Speed` — restores the clip to normal 1× speed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Snelheid Resetten` — herstelt de clip naar normale 1× snelheid."

#: ../clips.rst:333
msgid ":guilabel:`Reverse` — plays the clip backwards at normal speed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Omgekeerd` — speelt de clip achterwaarts af op normale snelheid."

#: ../clips.rst:334
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Speed Up` → Forward / Backward → 2×, 4×, 8×, 16× — speeds up "
