#: ../clips.rst:335
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Slow Down` → Forward / Backward → 1/2×, 1/4×, 1/8×, 1/16× — slows"
" down playback in either direction."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vertragen` → Vooruit / Achteruit → 1/2×, 1/4×, 1/8×, 1/16× — "
"vertraagt de weergave in beide richtingen."

#: ../clips.rst:336
msgid ":guilabel:`Repeat` — see below."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Herhalen` — zie hieronder."

#: ../clips.rst:337
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Freeze` — freezes on the frame at the current playhead position "
"for 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 20, or 30 seconds."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bevriezen` — bevriest het frame op de huidige afspeelkoppositie "
"voor 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 20 of 30 seconden."

#: ../clips.rst:338
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Freeze && Zoom` — freezes and simultaneously zooms in on that "
"frozen frame."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bevriezen & Zoomen` — bevriest en zoomt tegelijkertijd in op dat "
"bevroren frame."

#: ../clips.rst:340
msgid ""
"**Slow motion** — :guilabel:`Slow Down → 1/2×` or :guilabel:`1/4×` for "
"dreamy or dramatic footage."
msgstr ""
"**Slow motion** — :guilabel:`Vertragen → 1/2×` of :guilabel:`1/4×` voor "
"dromerige of dramatische beelden."

#: ../clips.rst:341
msgid ""
"**Time-lapse** — :guilabel:`Speed Up → 8×` or :guilabel:`16×` to compress "
"hours into seconds."
msgstr ""
"**Time-lapse** — :guilabel:`Versnellen → 8×` of :guilabel:`16×` om uren in "
"seconden samen te persen."

#: ../clips.rst:342
msgid ""
"**Speed ramp** — use the :guilabel:`Timing` tool to drag clip edges and "
"create a natural-feeling speed change; OpenShot scales all keyframes "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"**Snelheidsverloop** — gebruik het :guilabel:`Timing`-gereedschap om "
"clipranden te slepen en een natuurlijk aanvoelende snelheidsverandering te "
"creëren; OpenShot schaalt alle keyframes automatisch."

#: ../clips.rst:343
msgid ""
"**Tip:** Combine :guilabel:`Freeze` with :guilabel:`Speed Up` for an impact-"
"freeze-then-fast-forward effect."
msgstr ""
"**Tip:** Combineer :guilabel:`Bevriezen` met :guilabel:`Versnellen` voor een"
