"voegt fotografische korrel toe in verschillende sterktes en groottes."

#: ../clips.rst:416
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Analog Tape` → **No Analog Tape**, then: **Subtle**, **VHS**, "
"**Heavy** — adds tape noise and color degradation for a retro video look."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Analoge Tape` → **Geen Analoge Tape**, dan: **Subtiel**, **VHS**,"
