#: ../clips.rst:419
msgid "**Focus** — sharpness adjustments:"
msgstr "**Focus** — scherpte-aanpassingen:"

#: ../clips.rst:421
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sharpen` → **No Sharpen**, then: **Subtle**, **Medium**, "
"**Strong** — sharpens fine detail."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Verscherpen` → **Niet Verscherpen**, dan: **Subtiel**, "
"**Gemiddeld**, **Sterk** — verscherpt fijne details."

#: ../clips.rst:422
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Blur` → **No Blur**, then: **Soft Focus**, **Medium**, **Heavy** "
"— softens the image."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vervagen` → **Niet Vervagen**, dan: **Zacht Focus**, "
"**Gemiddeld**, **Zwaar** — maakt het beeld zachter."

#: ../clips.rst:424
msgid "**Lighting** — light and shadow overlays:"
msgstr "**Verlichting** — licht- en schaduwoverlays:"

#: ../clips.rst:426
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Shadow` → **No Shadow**, then: **Subtle**, **Soft**, **Strong**, "
"**Long** — casts a drop shadow across the clip."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Schaduw` → **Geen Schaduw**, dan: **Subtiel**, **Zacht**, "
"**Sterk**, **Lang** — werpt een slagschaduw over de clip."

#: ../clips.rst:428
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Glow` → **No Glow**, then: **Soft White**, **Warm**, **Neon**, "
"**Inner Glow** — adds a soft halo or glow effect."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Gloed` → **Geen Gloed**, dan: **Zacht Wit**, **Warm**, **Neon**, "
